            <p>For investors prioritizing monthly cash flow, these east-side and value-tier submarkets offer the strongest rent-to-price ratios in RLPM's service area. Whitehall and Eastmoor combine affordable entry points with steady workforce-tenant demand, while Blacklick and Reynoldsburg pair lower purchase prices with reliable east-side rental demand. Newark, on the Intel corridor, is an emerging value market worth watching on a longer horizon.</p>
