            <p>First-ring suburbs offer the cleanest balance of affordability and rental demand. <b>Reynoldsburg deserves particular attention in 2026:</b> the city has seen notable year-over-year sales activity increases, and its affordable entry points combined with solid rental demand make it a sweet spot for investors building a Columbus portfolio.</p>
