            <p>Columbus's southern suburbs continue to offer strong fundamentals for investors prioritizing tenant stability. Larger lots, lower property taxes than north-side suburbs, and school districts that attract family renters who stay for multiple lease terms. Proximity to Honda's large Marysville manufacturing complex, area data-center operations, and Anduril's new Arsenal-1 drone plant near Rickenbacker all add to workforce housing demand.</p>
